# Extension signing key — deriving the extension ID. NEVER commit.
key.pem

# Credentials of any kind
*.creds.json
.w2w_creds.json
*.pem

# Do NOT commit a signing public key either. Embedding one in manifest.json pins
# every install and every fork to one person's extension identity. The Chrome Web
# Store assigns the published ID; for local dev, Chrome assigns your own.
key.pub.txt

# Live board captures. These contain real coworker names and shift postings.
# Raw captures use these exact names, so blocking the pattern means an accidental
# capture can never be committed even by `git add -A`.
# Scrubbed fixtures are deliberately named differently (board-*.anon.html) so they
# fall outside this block — if a fixture matches a pattern here, it is NOT scrubbed.
*_capture.html
tb_*.html
drop_*.html
trade_*.html
mysched_*.html
td_*.html

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
